    },
    {
     "role": "heading",
     "order": 49,
     "text": "Phases of a Trial"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 50,
     "text": "Each clinical trial goes through several phases, each with a different purpose."
    },
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 51,
     "text": "Clinical trial phases",
     "href": "https://www.mdanderson.org/patients-family/diagnosis-treatment/clinical-trials/phases-of-clinical-trials.html"
    },
    {
     "role": "heading",
     "order": 52,
     "text": "Joining a Trial"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 53,
     "text": "Learn more about eligibility requirements to participate in a clinical trial."
    },
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 54,
     "text": "Deciding to join a trial",
     "href": "https://www.mdanderson.org/patients-family/diagnosis-treatment/clinical-trials/joining-a-clinical-trial.html"
    },
    {
